        <tr><td><strong>BV</strong></td><td>Boundary Violation</td><td>Agent exceeded authorization (permission issue, not comprehension)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>SC</strong></td><td>Spurious Compliance</td><td>Multiple readings available; agent picked one without justification</td></tr>
